Use music that features elements such as:
- Deep atmospheric drones.
- Low-frequency ambient tones.
- Subtle electronic pulses.
- Slow rhythmic percussion.
- Distant metallic sounds.
- Dark synthesizers.
- Tension-building strings.
- Subtle industrial textures.
- Gradually increasing intensity.
- Minimalistic cinematic soundscapes.

