All REVENANTS must receive:
- Extremely high movement speed.
- Very fast acceleration.
- Powerful directional changes.
- Rapid pursuit.
- Fast attack repositioning.
- Faster dash movement.
- Improved evasive maneuvers.
- Increased movement responsiveness.
- More aggressive target pursuit.

They should be noticeably faster than the normal versions of their corresponding units.

They must not feel like ordinary enemies with a purple outline.

### B. Advanced combat AI

Improve their combat intelligence.

REVENANTS should:
- Aggressively pursue their targets.
- Rapidly reposition when attacked.
- Predict player movement.
- Adapt to dashes and grappling.
- Attack from unexpected angles.
- Prioritize vulnerable squadmates.
