Their animations must remain synchronized with their actual movement speeds.

In particular:
- Spider legs must not glitch.
- Feet must not slide uncontrollably.
- Joints must not stretch.
- Bodies must remain connected to their limbs.
- Gait cycles must adjust to extreme speeds.
- Rapid direction changes must not break IK.
- Landing animations must remain stable.
- Attack animations must blend correctly with movement.

**A REVENANT that moves extremely fast but has broken or glitching leg animations is not acceptable.**

Do not consider the REVENANT speed overhaul complete until the procedural animations have been stress-tested at the new maximum movement speeds.

