# FINAL DESIGN REQUIREMENT

The music should create an atmosphere of constant suspense without overwhelming the player.

The procedural animation system must be reliable enough to handle extremely fast bosses and REVENANTS without broken legs, snapping joints, or unnatural movement.

Training mode should become a genuine Sandbox where the player can spawn any unit or enemy, create custom battles, test every REVENANT, and experiment freely without affecting normal game progression.

REVENANTS should become terrifyingly fast and powerful. They must be capable of overwhelming the player through aggressive movement, devastating attacks, and improved combat intelligence.

Most importantly, **animation quality must keep up with gameplay speed.** The game should not sacrifice visual stability just to make units move faster.

The intended result is a much more atmospheric, customizable, and intense combat experience, with stable high-speed procedural animations even during the most chaotic encounters.